Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: The number of `:Fixed(n)` is Float (an approximate binary number), not Int
  --> tests/ui/fixed_interpolation_malformed_precision.jet:3:25
    |
  3 |     print("{value:Fixed(1.5)}")
    |                         ^^^
 Why: A selector number is an Int, written as a literal or computed at run time
 Fix: Pass an Int, such as `:Pad(width)` with `width: Int`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
